'''Difficulty:''' ★★☆☆☆

'''Battle:''' Use Bellydance Cat and Fishman Cat to kill Doge Dark, then start stalling Possessed Empress at the enemy base as best you can. Periodically send out Barrel Cats to hopefully pierce her Shield and knock her back when the enemies inevitably start pushing. Neo Cutter Cat and Fishman will be doing a majority of the heavy lifting in terms of DPS vs. the peons, as Pizza Cat is too slow to reach the frontlines before getting done in by Possessed Empress's Mini-Waves. Use Awakened Bahamut Cat to kill either the first or second Aku Gory to alleviate some of the pressure. You can start sending out Pizza Cats when each respective Shadow Boxer K appears, since they are the strongest pusher here. Take care of the first one normally, after which, Bahamut will be off cooldown, so you can completely eviscerate the second one with him. Cleanup is simple enough, although it depends mostly on Barrel Cat Shield Pierce procs.

